{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2500","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2500/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2500/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2500/events","html_url":"https://github.com/less/less.js/issues/2500","id":60745370,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU2MDc0NTM3MA==","number":2500,"title":"[DOCUMENTATION] Programmatically using the paths configuration with a string results in an obscure error when using data-uri function","user":{"login":"mschnee","id":1375316,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzUzMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1375316?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschnee","html_url":"https://github.com/mschnee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschnee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschnee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschnee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschnee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschnee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschnee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschnee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschnee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mschnee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2103265,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTAzMjY1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"e10c02","default":true,"description":null},{"id":9603697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NjAzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/labels/low%20priority","name":"low priority","color":"02e10c","default":false,"description":null},{"id":43298702,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MzI5ODcwMg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/labels/up-for-grabs","name":"up-for-grabs","color":"006b75","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2015-03-11T23:09:42Z","updated_at":"2015-03-19T08:16:20Z","closed_at":"2015-03-19T08:16:20Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When using the data-uri function while the paths options is a string instead of an array.\nIn \nfileManager.loadFileSync() called from functionRegistry.add(\"data-uri\");\nfile-manager.js expects paths to be an array.\nlib/less/less-node/file-manager.js line 75:\n\n```\n if (options.paths) {\n        paths.push.apply(paths, options.paths);\n    }\n```\n\nIf you try to supply a string, you will receive an ambiguous error:\n\n```\n'error evaluating function `data-uri`: Function.prototype.apply: Arguments list has wrong type in file /Users/mschnee/Projects/testapp/src/less/lib/ie-old.less\n```\n\nThe solution for the end user is to change their usage of the paths option from a string to an array.  \n\n```\noptions = { paths: \"target/css\" };\noptions = { paths: [\"target/css\"] };\n```\n\nUsers used to using gulp and glob are likely to expect strings and arrays of strings to be used interchangibly.\n\nEither the documentation should be updated to reflect this fact, or the `options.paths` check above should promote the value to array (can PR if desired)\n","closed_by":{"login":"SomMeri","id":618879,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxODg3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/618879?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri","html_url":"https://github.com/SomMeri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SomMeri/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2500/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2500/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}